+Agent Development Kit (ADK) for Aegis — README
+
+This ADK scaffold provides:
+- SDK: lightweight Agent runtime interfaces (Agent, Planner, Executor, Enforcer)
+- Recorder: standardized action/observation trace recorder (ndjson)
+- Evidence helpers: bundle + cosign support for signed evidence artifacts
+- Sample agent: minimal agent that runs a simple plan against a simulated environment
+- CI: GitHub Actions workflow to run tests, produce signed evidence and run a sim integration smoke test
+- PoA integration script: include ADK traces into PoA evidence bundles
+- Docs: design doc and operator runbook
+
+This scaffold is intentionally small and extensible — replace sim/HIL adapters, planner, enforcer
+and signing endpoints with your production implementations.
